@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC14 Quan ly ma QR gan POI Tour

actor "Admin / ContentAdmin" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebAdminUI - QrListPage va QrForm" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nQrController + QrService + SoftDeleteService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nQrRepository + PoiRepository + TourRepository + DeletedRecordRepository + DbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Mo danh sach QR
UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau doc danh sach
Business -> Business: Kiem tra quyen ContentManagement
Business -> DataAccess: Doc QrLocation
DataAccess -> Database: Doc du lieu QR va target
Database --> DataAccess: Tra danh sach
DataAccess --> Business: Tra ket qua
Business --> UI: Hien thi QR

alt Tao hoac cap nhat QR
  Actor -> UI: Chon POI/Tour va cau hinh access
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau luu QR
  Business -> DataAccess: Kiem tra target ton tai
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc Poi hoac Tour
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra target
  alt Target, gia va thoi luong hop le
    Business -> Business: Sinh code duy nhat neu tao moi
    Business -> DataAccess: Ghi QrLocation
    DataAccess -> Database: Tao hoac cap nhat QR
    Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
    Business --> UI: Tra QR da luu
    UI --> Actor: Cap nhat danh sach va ma QR
  else Chon sai target hoac cau hinh khong hop le
    Business --> UI: Tra thong bao loi
    UI --> Actor: Hien thi loi form
  end
else Xoa QR
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau xoa
  Business -> DataAccess: Doc QR va ghi xoa mem
  DataAccess -> Database: Cap nhat DeletedAt va DeletedRecord
  Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
  Business --> UI: Tra ket qua
  UI --> Actor: Cap nhat danh sach
end
@enduml
